course: dictionary
lesson: 8813
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. To find the right one, look at the words around them. «Zara in Cape Town said load-shedding had stopped her, but her teacher checked the power-cut schedule: that evening the cut was in another part of town, not in her area.» The clues are power-cut and schedule, so load-shedding means a planned power cut.
explain: Shedding is a verb form of shed. It can mean losing something naturally, like hair or skin, or getting rid of something you no longer want. Ask yourself which meaning fits the sentence, then try it out in place of the hard word.
explain: Sometimes a word is used in a phrase, and the phrase has its own meaning. «Shedding light on» a problem means explaining it, so the words around it matter more than the single word.
fact: Shed can mean to lose something naturally, like skin, leaves or hair.
fact: «Snakes shed their skin» means snakes lose their old skin.
fact: «Shedding tears» means letting tears fall.
fact: «Shedding light on» something means explaining it.
fact: Load-shedding, used in South Africa, is a planned power cut, as in «Zara in Cape Town said load-shedding had stopped her».
exercise: The dog is shedding hair all over the sofa. What does shedding mean? | Cutting hair short | Growing a long new coat | Washing hair with soap | *Losing hair naturally
exercise: «Zara in Cape Town said load-shedding had stopped her, but her teacher checked the power-cut schedule.» What is load-shedding? | A type of music | Going on a long holiday | *A planned power cut | A rule about homework
exercise: «that evening the cut was in another part of town, not in her area.» Find and copy one word that tells you the cut was not in Zara's area. | evening | schedule | teacher | *another
test: Snakes are shedding their skin. What is happening? | *Losing their old skin naturally | Sleeping in the warm grass | Growing a new tail | Being painted by the sun
test: «The new evidence is shedding light on the mystery.» What does shedding light on mean? | Hiding the problem | Making the mystery louder | Turning off the lights | *Explaining the mystery clearly
exam: A lorry is shedding its load on the road. What does shedding mean? | *Dropping something from it onto the road | Painting the lorry | Driving very fast | Cleaning the road
